  { title: 'Authorized channels only', body: ['The tool may be used only with channels that the operator is authorized to manage. Each brand profile is bound to an expected YouTube channel ID, and cross-brand credential fallback is not permitted.']},
  { title: 'Publication controls', body: ['Uploading or publishing requires the configured channel authorization and the tool’s applicable content, provenance, quality, and rendering checks. A local render, an accepted upload, or a private processing state is not treated as a verified public publication.']},
  { title: 'Google and YouTube terms', body: ['Use of YouTube API Services is subject to the YouTube Terms of Service and applicable Google API policies. The operator may revoke Google authorization at any time.']},
  { title: 'Contact', body: ['Questions about this operator tool can be sent to onnellab.app@gmail.com.']}
];
